{'symbol': 'RMD', 'date': '2023-03-30 16:05:00', 'title': 'RESMED CHIEF ADMINISTRATIVE OFFICER AND GLOBAL GENERAL COUNSEL TO RETIRE', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, MARCH 30, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- RESMED (NYSE: RMD, ASX: RMD) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT DAVID PENDARVIS, CHIEF ADMINISTRATIVE OFFICER, GLOBAL GENERAL COUNSEL, AND SECRETARY, PLANS TO RETIRE, EFFECTIVE JUNE 30, 2023. HE WILL REMAIN IN A CONSULTING ROLE WITH RESMED THROUGH DECEMBER 31, 2023.'}